  "instructions": [
    "Preheat waffle iron to medium-high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together flour, baking powder, salt, and sugar.",
    "In a separate bowl, whisk together milk, egg, and vegetable oil.",
    "Add the wet ingredients to the dry ingredients and stir until just combined.",
    "Do not overmix.",
    "Add the chopped hash and stir until evenly distributed.",
    "Pour about 1/4 cup of the batter onto the center of the waffle iron.",
    "Cook for 3-5 minutes or until the waffles are golden brown.",
    "Repeat with remaining batter.",
